From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: etna-ify <etna-ify@local>
Date: Thu, 1 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix OrdPSQ tree balancing logic (issue #60)

Synthetic restatement of upstream commit 6a4a2b735be37099738ace78c28a252dd5391a39
("Fix OrdPSQ tree balancing logic. fixes #60 (#61)") narrowed to the
`lbalance`/`rbalance` rewrite. The pre-fix version short-circuited
unconditionally whenever either child was `Start`, even when the other
child was deeply nested -- so the omega-rebalancing trigger never fired
on those nodes, producing trees that satisfy the BST and heap
invariants but violate the omega-balance invariant.

`hasBalancedTreeProperty` (already in `valid` on modern HEAD) is left
untouched here, so reverse-applying this patch produces a tree that
fails `valid` after a long ascending insert sequence.
---
 src/Data/OrdPSQ/Internal.hs | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/Data/OrdPSQ/Internal.hs b/src/Data/OrdPSQ/Internal.hs
index 3aefa18..5472e4c 100644
--- a/src/Data/OrdPSQ/Internal.hs
+++ b/src/Data/OrdPSQ/Internal.hs
@@ -519,16 +519,14 @@ rloser k p v tl m tr = RLoser (1 + size' tl + size' tr) (E k p v) tl m tr
 lbalance, rbalance
     :: (Ord k, Ord p)
     => k -> p -> v -> LTree k p v -> k -> LTree k p v -> LTree k p v
-lbalance k p v Start m r        = lloser        k p v Start m r
-lbalance k p v l m Start        = lloser        k p v l m Start
 lbalance k p v l m r
+    | size' r + size' l < 2     = lloser        k p v l m r
     | size' r > omega * size' l = lbalanceLeft  k p v l m r
     | size' l > omega * size' r = lbalanceRight k p v l m r
     | otherwise                 = lloser        k p v l m r
 
-rbalance k p v Start m r        = rloser        k p v Start m r
-rbalance k p v l m Start        = rloser        k p v l m Start
 rbalance k p v l m r
+    | size' r + size' l < 2     = rloser        k p v l m r
     | size' r > omega * size' l = rbalanceLeft  k p v l m r
     | size' l > omega * size' r = rbalanceRight k p v l m r
     | otherwise                 = rloser        k p v l m r

